WEBVTT

00:00:00.807 --> 00:00:02.354
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <i><b>Life in a day</b></i>

00:00:06.192 --> 00:00:12.552
Early in the morning in the USA, a baby opened his eyes and looked at his mother.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.687
‘Isn’t he pretty?’ she asked the camera.

00:00:17.891 --> 00:00:22.843
Around the world, people got up, and washed, and had breakfast.

00:00:23.778 --> 00:00:29.577
A 15-yearold boy shaved for the first time. He didn’t enjoy it!

00:00:30.648 --> 00:00:33.202
A boy kissed his mother on her birthday.

00:00:34.846 --> 00:00:40.638
The 24th of July was a Saturday, so a lot of people didn’t go to work.

00:00:41.368 --> 00:00:46.315
They relaxed and went to the park with their family, or went shopping.

00:00:47.654 --> 00:00:51.702
But other people worked hard, or cooked and cleaned.

00:00:52.663 --> 00:01:00.697
Some children played – but others worked. One small boy cleaned shoes in the street.

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:10.064
One woman went to hospital for an operation. Another woman waited all evening to talk to her husband on Skype.

00:01:11.131 --> 00:01:14.476
He was a soldier thousands of miles from home.

00:01:16.217 --> 00:01:20.554
For some people, the 24th of July was a special day.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:27.145
A man arrived in Kathmandu. He was on a cycle trip around the world.

00:01:28.269 --> 00:01:31.090
A woman did an incredible skydive.

00:01:31.994 --> 00:01:34.974
An unemployed man got his first job.

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:42.367
A boy who was at university went home to see his father for the first time in three years.

00:01:43.364 --> 00:01:46.575
Another man asked his girlfriend to marry him.

00:01:48.955 --> 00:01:53.402
A man and a woman got married and had an incredible party.

00:01:54.265 --> 00:02:03.886
This beautiful film shows us life around the world in the 21st century. Watch it! It’s free on YouTube